<div class="autoscroll"><table class="list periodic-metric-table">
  <caption><%= measure == :count ? 'Tickets' : 'Complexity Weight' %> — <%= @selected_owners.size > 1 ? 'team totals' : 'selected owner' %></caption>
  <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Plan / Expectation</th><th>Actual</th><th>Deviation</th><th>Deviation calculation</th><th>Deviation %</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody><% TicketJourneyPeriodicTickets.metric_rows(report, measure).each do |row| %>
    <tr class="<%= 'periodic-total-row' if %w[expected actual].include?(row[:key]) %>">
      <th><%= TicketJourneyPeriodicTickets::LABELS.fetch(row[:key]) %></th>
      <td><%= row[:plan].positive? ? periodic_ticket_link(performance_number(row[:plan]), row[:key] == 'actual' ? 'expected' : row[:key]) : performance_number(row[:plan]) %></td>
      <% actual_metric = %w[planned hotfix].include?(row[:key]) ? "completed_#{row[:key]}" : (row[:key] == 'expected' ? 'completed' : row[:key]) %>
      <td><%= periodic_ticket_link(performance_number(row[:actual]), actual_metric) %></td>
      <td><%= periodic_ticket_link(periodic_deviation(row[:deviation][:value]), TicketJourneyPeriodicTickets::DEVIATION_METRICS.fetch(row[:key])) %></td>
      <td><%= row[:direction] == :plan_minus_actual ? 'P−A' : 'A−P' %><%= '*' if row[:key] == 'actual' %></td>
      <td><%= row[:deviation][:percent].nil? ? 'N/A' : safe_join([periodic_deviation(row[:deviation][:percent]), '%']) %></td>
    </tr>
  <% end %></tbody>
</table></div>
<p class="performance-weight-note">P = Plan / Expectation. A = Actual. Debt's target is zero, while its opening workload contributes to Expected Total. Weight sums use usable visible values. * Total Actual Done includes Other Done. Its deviation is capped at zero when Expected Total deviation is nonzero.</p>
